'''Nicholas M. Nighswander''' (born November 3, 1952) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Center (American football)|center]] for the [[Buffalo Bills]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) in 1974. He played [[college football]] for the [[Morehead State Eagles football|Morehead State Eagles]].

