'''Nick Taylor''' (born March 27, 1988) is an American professional [[Canadian football|football]] [[defensive back]]. He is a three-time [[Grey Cup]] champion after winning with [[Ottawa Redblacks]] in [[104th Grey Cup|2016]] and with the [[Winnipeg Blue Bombers]] in [[107th Grey Cup|2019]] and [[108th Grey Cup|2021]].
